      "recommended_approach": "Add HealthCheck(ctx context.Context) error to the Discoverer interface in discovery/discovery.go. Then add a default implementation on refresh.Discovery in discovery/refresh/refresh.go — this covers ~25 embedded discoverers automatically. Then add HealthCheck to the remaining ~12 direct implementors (staticDiscoverer, file.Discovery, consul.Discovery, zookeeper.Discovery, xds.fetchDiscovery, and the 7 kubernetes sub-discoverers). The kubernetes.Discovery could delegate to its sub-discoverers' health checks.",
